Package: listful
Title: Build an Object Step by Step from a List
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Geordie", "McRuer", , "geo.mcruer@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Small helpers that build up an object by applying a function to it once for
    each element of a list (or two lists), as a loop-free alternative to
    'Reduce()'. Used by the other in-house packages.
